me": "0", "image": "engenn8le18ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le18ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Okay, so I was playing the devil's advocate today, but you really need to reflect on the pros and cons of going back to school at this point in your life.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I know. I'm just generally not that comfortable listing reasons.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That's why we're going to do it together. It will be interesting! You need to think about your preferences.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It will definitely help me make up my mind."}, {"time": "21250", "image": "engenn8le18ob04re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Okay, so how about talking first about the positive aspects of you going back to school?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It will be fun and interesting to learn new things. I'll make new friends. I'll improve myself. I might be able to kick off a new career related to my studies.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Great! You have lots of different reasons that you should go to school. Now, what are some reasons that going back to school is not a good idea?"}, {"time": "45200", "image": "engenn8le18ob04re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It will be very expensive. I'm not really sure what I want to study so I might squander resources like time and money studying something that I end up not wanting to build a career in.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Okay. Those are some pretty strong cons. You need to carefully consider these points before you make your decision.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: All this thinking is making me ravenous! Let's go to a restaurant!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Good idea! All I've eaten today is chocolate."}]}}], "id": 1}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata"